<title>USA: Hempstead, N.Y., $5.410 mln won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Hempstead, N.Y., $5.410 mln won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross Inc. said it won $5.410 million of Hempstead, N.Y., various purpose bonds, 1997, Series B, with a net interest cost of 5.36 percent.</p>
